{"version":1,"content":"<p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今晚舉行，一眾小生花旦盛裝打扮現身紅地氈，其中近日因《女神配對計劃2》是非纏身的小花何沛珈，未知是否受此影響，打扮亦變得保守，以全黑連身裙包到冚，只側邊開衩露腿，與昔日的珠片紮胸及真空透視裝大有出入。</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:15:37.978874+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:22:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:08:55.082341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:08:55.082341+00:00","content_hash":"000bfaaae8382fd63bbab441a0a9bff6ef6237c43a2fc1b669cd9fdd4962d87d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}